  "clips": [
    {
      "chinese": "前面有巡警。靠著岩石走，別站在路中央。",
      "seconds": 7.381333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/b2a4a9a44732f43d0664",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "靠著掩體接近，再用刀。別迎著槍口衝。",
      "seconds": 4.48,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/054c70e7b9fb9bf11c7f",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "槍打完一發，就要再裝一發。裝填時躲好。",
      "seconds": 6.474666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/52ceab4b6cc98bd149ca",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "警察正在瞄準，移到岩石或木箱後！",
      "seconds": 5.674666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/463ca8251281eec5bf38",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "前面的路通了。比胡，看看大家有沒有跟上。",
      "seconds": 4.981333333333334,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/5f3c03835e4d9b379535",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我在。走吧，到學校外和達多會合。",
      "seconds": 5.8773333333333335,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/3f25818da11f55181624",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "巴萬正在前方集合，比胡會跟上。",
      "seconds": 4.181333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/61c99249424c081dd14a",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "巡警已退下，巴萬在前方帶路。",
      "seconds": 5.376,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/aa223d0704e8315e9e8c",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "巴萬與比胡在前方等你，走近後繼續。",
      "seconds": 7.274666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/d2de46f22b8e618a7ac7",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "嘿，我們是打日本警察，不要攻擊我。",
      "seconds": 6.976,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/8bfd76192665c6bc35d5",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "你還沒告訴過我你的名字。你希望我怎麼叫你？",
      "seconds": 5.578666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/1b6f740b96e7485dcfc4",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我是巴萬·拿威，和你一起行動的同伴。",
      "seconds": 4.384,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/6dc3c7d1fc02380de778",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "這裡是馬赫坡駐在所。我們先聽莫那的安排，再沿山路去霧社學校外和達多會合。",
      "seconds": 11.477333333333334,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/0c74d84b3c7c93e6efa4",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "比胡·帖木是我們的同伴，他會和我們一起走。",
      "seconds": 4.682666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/66d93de919811740e757",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "莫那·魯道在前面建築旁，等一下我們一起去聽他的安排。",
      "seconds": 8.576,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/11e54b05a9f441f3693c",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "莫那會讓你選獵刀或村田十八年式步槍，只能帶一種。",
      "seconds": 9.973333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/c730e391712720009910",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "族人長期受勞役與欺壓，才決定起事。眼前先聽莫那安排，大家彼此照應。",
      "seconds": 13.866666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/fda461032b455fddbd80",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我也會緊張。跟緊我們，有事就叫我。",
      "seconds": 6.08,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/d10781d38412c5bdde0d",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "好，保持間距，別烙單了!",
      "seconds": 3.1786666666666665,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/8636a062c42dd4733255",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "這個問題我現在答不上來。先去見莫那，聽聽他的安排。",
      "seconds": 8.48,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/7d21c432b38dc33c655b",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "比胡還活著。先讓他坐著休息，我會照看他。",
      "seconds": 6.677333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/ad2a7bf7bb4769e41441",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我還在……謝謝你沒有把我留在那裡。",
      "seconds": 5.28,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/eb334bd29bc31519f9eb",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "人帶回來了。先把大家清點清楚。",
      "seconds": 7.082666666666666,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/04651651ae98334ae454",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我回去找他。你們在這裡等。",
      "seconds": 4.384,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/8198378b7c41d4e78179",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
