      "chinese": "等等聽到信號，我會進去運動場。巴萬打通左側通道，比胡負責右側掩護。你選一隊跟上。",
      "seconds": 15.968,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/9f07aaf3d40bdb09d41d",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "跟緊各自的領隊，別落單。最後在校後空地集合。",
      "seconds": 8.981333333333334,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/81d1949964716be76014",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "會場遭到襲擊，日本平民也遭到殺害。人群在槍聲與呼喊中四散。",
      "seconds": 12.576,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/0adb8041ca793ce2ca4e",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "各隊照分工走！我進會場，巴萬走左邊，比胡走右邊。校後會合！",
      "seconds": 12.576,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/1059d3db13b95839bc84",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "跟緊我，從校門進去！別讓同伴落單，留意會場裡的動靜。",
      "seconds": 11.072,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/9f7f8c1e0a14e953a4fa",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "跟我來，打開側邊通路，讓同伴能從那邊撤出！",
      "seconds": 8.373333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/ace1044f96f2802bb7f9",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "跟我走右側。我聽你的信號前進，必要時叫我撤回！",
      "seconds": 3.8826666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/ee7b17d1199bfdf3f5af",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": " 段安全位置重試。\n已完成段落、任務與武器選擇保留。",
      "seconds": 5.28,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/198fd44f5f1f45a746ff",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "從目前任務起點重試。\n任務與武器選擇保留。",
      "seconds": 3.8826666666666667,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/77f93d055fb1d94927da",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "我們把左邊打通了，側門已經打開。你們都到了嗎？",
      "seconds": 9.077333333333334,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/82cf70b539895a79e98f",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "左邊的通道打通了，側門已經打開。我們在這裡接應。",
      "seconds": 7.381333333333333,
      "peak": 32767,
      "resource": "Chapter3Voice/Audio/ba682d66379319b64809",
      "reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "chinese": "到了！剛才他替我看住警察，我才能穿過右邊。",
